[00:11.31]Coming in unannounced, drag my nails on the tile
[00:11.31]用指甲刮着瓷砖，我毫无预兆地闯入
[00:14.24]I just followed your scent, you can just follow my smile
[00:14.24]我追踪着你的气味，你大可追随我的微笑
